  "title": "Smart Electric Scalp Massager \u2013 Portable & Stress-Relieving",
  "body_html": "<p>The primary benefit of the <strong>Smart Electric Scalp Massager</strong> is its ability to deliver soothing, relaxing massages that improve scalp circulation. Designed for stress relief and hair care, this portable head massager features soft rotating nodes that gently stimulate the scalp, helping to reduce tension and promote overall relaxation. Easy to hold and operate, it is perfect for use at home or while travelling, providing a spa-like experience anytime you need a moment of calm.</p><h2>Key features</h2><ul>\n<li>Smart electric scalp massager with soft, rotating massage nodes</li>\n<li>Enhances scalp blood circulation for healthier hair</li>\n<li>Compact, ergonomic, and easy to grip design</li>\n<li>Helps relieve stress and fatigue effectively</li>\n<li>Suitable for dry, gentle massage use</li>\n<li>Portable and rechargeable, ideal for home and travel</li>\n</ul><h2>Materials &amp; care</h2><p>Handle made of durable plastic with soft massage nodes. Wipe clean with a damp cloth. Do not immerse in water.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><dl>\n<dt>Q1: How does the scalp massager improve hair health?</dt>\n<dd>A: The gentle massage stimulates scalp blood flow, promoting healthier hair growth and overall scalp health.</dd>\n<dt>Q2: Is the device suitable for all scalp types?</dt>\n<dd>A: Yes, it is designed for gentle use on all scalp types, including sensitive skin.</dd>\n<dt>Q3: How long does the battery last?</dt>\n<dd>A: The device is rechargeable via USB and offers several sessions of use per charge, typically around 1-2 hours.</dd>\n<dt>Q4: Can it be used during shower or with water?</dt>\n<dd>A: No, it is not waterproof. Use dry or on a dry scalp only.</dd>\n</dl>",
